Subject: [PATCH 10/13] bootanimation: play the YRRP Matrix boot animation

Renders katakana rain with a decoding YRRP mark on boot and shutdown. Lineage's zip remains as a Settings choice and as the fallback when assets or shaders fail; decisions are published as sys.yrrp.bootanim.* properties.

